#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: Confirm deployment and establish the immediate objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l001"
msgstr "TORRE, despliegue confirmado. Torre residencial Ashfall, sector siete."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: State the required mission sequence concisely.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l002"
msgstr "Restaura la energía del sector, recupera al equipo de seguridad atrapado y alcanza el enlace de tránsito."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Establish that VECTOR is active elsewhere in Ashfall District.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l001"
msgstr "TORRE, VECTOR. Estoy dos cuadras al este. El mismo fuego, las mismas comunicaciones muertas."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Direct attention toward the drones without stopping the tutorial.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l002"
msgstr "Algo está dirigiendo a los drones hacia los pisos ocupados. Lo rastrearé desde aquí."

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Introduce the first contradiction in ROOK’s remembered history.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l001"
msgstr "¿Capitán?"

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Make the recognition specific without explaining it.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l002"
msgstr "Te vi morir en Kestrel Bridge. Hace ocho años."

#. Speaker: ROOK
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Keep ROOK controlled and focused on the rescue.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l003"
msgstr "Tienes al soldado equivocado. ¿Puedes moverte?"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Offer a plausible explanation while redirecting the mission.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l001"
msgstr "La exposición neurológica puede producir un falso reconocimiento y proyección de identidad."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Close the interruption and return the player to the objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l002"
msgstr "Asegure al sobreviviente y continúe el tránsito."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M06 arrival; OPERATOR's final direct address before becoming unreachable.
#: missions/m06.md
msgid "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"
msgstr "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M09 Imprint Zero activation; machine-directed command, not an address to the crew.
